{% comment %}
  Product: Related items — native rebuild of the PageFly "You may also
  like" row on the product pages: a Display-Light heading above up to four
  clickable cards, each an image with a 14px title and a one-line
  subtitle beneath ("Hanging Strips — Fix your Stendig to the walls,
  without nails"). The image shape is the section's own choice of 1:1 or
  4:5 — the same toggle the collection grids carry, and defaulting to
  1:1 here because that is the shape this row has always drawn.
  Cards take an optional product pick (supplies the link automatically)
  or a custom link. An optional Variant SKU narrows the card to one
  variant — its image, its ?variant= link, its colour appended to the
  title — so several cards can point at different colours of the same
  product. Each card carries the warehouse-aware Sold out / Last few
  stock pill.
  A card that points at the page currently being viewed (same product,
  and same variant when a SKU is set) hides itself, so up to 8 cards can
  be stocked while only the first 4 eligible ones show — spares fill the
  row when the self-reference rule knocks one out. Editable: heading and
  cards. Type/spacing locked.
{% endcomment %}

{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel {
    padding: 0 20px 80px;
    max-width: var(--st-page-max, 1440px);
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__heading {
    font-family: "Neue Haas Grotesk Display", var(--font-heading-family), sans-serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0 -5px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__card {
    flex: 0 0 50%;
    max-width: 50%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 0 5px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__card {
      flex: 0 0 25%;
      max-width: 25%;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
  /* position: relative anchors the absolute stock pill */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__media {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
  }
  {%- comment -%}
    Both boxes take the SAME ratio. An empty card holds the row's shape
    while the picture it is waiting for is chosen, so a placeholder that
    kept 1:1 while its neighbours went portrait would leave a step in a
    row whose whole job is to line four things up.

    The test is for '4-5', not for '1-1', and that direction is
    load-bearing. Every product template already carries this section
    with no image_ratio stored, so an unset value has to land on the
    square this row has always drawn — testing the other way would turn
    every live product page portrait if the stored value were ever
    missing rather than defaulted.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__card img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: {% if section.settings.image_ratio == '4-5' %}4 / 5{% else %}1 / 1{% endif %};
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__placeholder {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: {% if section.settings.image_ratio == '4-5' %}4 / 5{% else %}1 / 1{% endif %};
    background: #f3f3f3;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__title {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 21px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #121212;
    margin: 14px 0 3px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 21px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #121212;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel { padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 12px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .prel__heading { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="prel">
  {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
    <h2 class="prel__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="prel__cards">
      {%- assign shown_cards = 0 -%}
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          if shown_cards >= 4
            break
          endif

          assign card_product = block.settings.product

          # Optional variant targeting by SKU (exact, case-insensitive) —
          # lets several cards point at different colours of one product.
          assign card_variant = false
          if block.settings.variant_sku != blank and card_product != blank
            assign sku_needle = block.settings.variant_sku | strip | downcase
            for v in card_product.variants
              assign v_sku = v.sku | strip | downcase
              if v_sku == sku_needle
                assign card_variant = v
                break
              endif
            endfor
          endif

          # Self-reference rule: skip the card that points at the page the
          # visitor is already on — the whole product when no SKU is set,
          # or that exact variant when one is. Later blocks fill the slot.
          if card_product != blank and product != blank and card_product.id == product.id
            if card_variant
              if card_variant.id == product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id
                continue
              endif
            else
              continue
            endif
          endif
          assign shown_cards = shown_cards | plus: 1

          assign card_url = block.settings.link
          if card_url == blank and card_product != blank
            if card_variant
              assign card_url = card_product.url | append: '?variant=' | append: card_variant.id
            else
              assign card_url = card_product.url
            endif
          endif

          assign card_image = block.settings.image
          if card_image == blank and card_variant and card_variant.image
            assign card_image = card_variant.image
          endif
          if card_image == blank
            assign card_image = card_product.featured_media
          endif

          assign card_title = block.settings.title
          if card_title == blank
            assign card_title = card_product.title
            if card_variant and card_product.has_only_default_variant == false
              assign card_title = card_title | append: ' — ' | append: card_variant.title
            endif
          endif

          assign stock_state = ''
          if card_product != blank
            capture stock_state
              render 'stock-state', product: card_product, variant: card_variant
            endcapture
            # strip is load-bearing: stray capture whitespace breaks the
            # modifier class and the == comparisons
            assign stock_state = stock_state | strip
          endif
        -%}
        <a href="{{ card_url | default: '#' }}" class="prel__card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <span class="prel__media">
            {%- if stock_state != blank -%}
              <span class="st-stock-pill st-stock-pill--{{ stock_state }}" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="st-stock-pill__dot"></span>
                {%- if stock_state == 'sold_out' -%}{{ 'products.product.stock_sold_out' | t }}{%- else -%}{{ 'products.product.stock_last_few' | t }}{%- endif -%}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if card_image != blank -%}
              <img
                src="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 750 }}"
                srcset="{{ card_image | image_url: width: 375 }} 375w, {{ card_image | image_url: width: 550 }} 550w, {{ card_image | image_url: width: 750 }} 750w, {{ card_image | image_url: width: 1024 }} 1024w"
                sizes="(min-width: 750px) 25vw, 50vw"
                width="{{ card_image.width }}"
                height="{{ card_image.height }}"
                alt="{{ card_title | escape }}"
                loading="lazy"
              >
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="prel__placeholder" role="presentation"></span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>

          {%- if card_title != blank -%}
            <h3 class="prel__title">
              {{ card_title | escape }}
              {%- if stock_state == 'sold_out' -%}
                <span class="visually-hidden"> &mdash; {{ 'products.product.stock_sold_out' | t }}</span>
              {%- elsif stock_state == 'last_few' -%}
                <span class="visually-hidden"> &mdash; {{ 'products.product.stock_last_few' | t }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </h3>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.subtitle != blank -%}
            <p class="prel__subtitle">{{ block.settings.subtitle | escape }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product: Related items",
  "max_blocks": 8,
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "You may also like" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "image_ratio",
      "label": "Image aspect ratio",
      "options": [
        { "value": "4-5", "label": "4:5 (portrait)" },
        { "value": "1-1", "label": "1:1 (square)" }
      ],
      "default": "1-1",
      "info": "Applies to every card in this section."
    },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Only the first 4 eligible cards show. A card pointing at the product (or variant) currently being viewed hides itself, and the next card fills its place — so cards 5–8 act as backups." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "card",
      "name": "Card",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "Product", "info": "Optional. Supplies the link, image and title unless overridden below." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "variant_sku", "label": "Variant SKU", "info": "Optional. Points the card at one variant of the product above: its image, a link straight to it, and its colour added to the title (e.g. SC26R for the red V Calendar)." },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image", "info": "Optional override. Cropped to the section's image aspect ratio." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "info": "Optional override." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "subtitle", "label": "Subtitle", "placeholder": "Fix your Stendig to the walls, without nails" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "Link", "info": "Optional override of the product's link." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Product: Related items",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "card" },
        { "type": "card" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
